      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَبْسٌ</span></b>  Anything <i>black.</i> (Lth, A, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,
app.,] Much people; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِبْسٌ</span></b> : (IAar, K:)
the former is also common to other things; (M, *
TA;) so that you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَالٌ دَبْسٌ</span>, meaning <i>much
property.</i> (TA.)

